<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Methanex started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Methanex started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Donald Pattison has resumed coverage of Canada's Methanex Corp with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In an April 23 report, Pattison said the company had enough cash to complete the world's biggest methanol plant, on the Straits of Magellan in Chile.</p>
<p>-- &quot;By the end of 1998, extra cash flow could permit repayment of all long-term debt and the repurchase of 16 million more shares (nine percent of shares then outstanding),&quot; he wrote.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
